00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:35.110
And on GMM on the following Monday,

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.610
what we were gonna announce the logo

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.500
and announce the new merch
collection with the logo.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.823
So on Friday before a
holiday weekend, essentially,

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.220
which is just typical,

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.470
if we're gonna announce
something on Monday,

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.763
