were getting a new logo,

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.910
but that if you wanted
to get Randler merch,

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:00.443
Randler being the mascot,

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:04.900
the little mouse with antlers and wings,

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:07.663
it's been a mascot of
Mythicality for a very long time.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.580
If you wanted to get Randler merch,

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.410
you needed to act on it right now

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.520
because that was going away.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.353
Now-

00:04:15.353 --> 00:04:16.610
It may have said forever, I don't know.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.570
No it said.
I hope not.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:20.940
The implication was that
it was going away forever.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.510
It was an unfortunately worded thing.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:27.820
Right, so it seemed, it
was an email about merch

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:32.820
that seemed like it was an
announcement about the new logo,

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.000
which doesn't have the Randler in it,

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.260
