00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:40.370
that the Randler was going away forever.

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.767
Yeah, and so.

00:04:41.767 --> 00:04:43.430
And in a livestream.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.660
In the livestream on the society...

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.800
We did clarify this the very next week.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.653
Which was on Tuesday of that week,

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:54.230
