00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.780
When what we were trying
to say is that that line,

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.470
that iteration of the Randler as it exists

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:14.160
as part of the company-wide
logo is going away.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.510
So get it while you can get it

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:18.700
in the same way that we always
say about last chance stuff.

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.150
And I think there was a bit
of a marketing spin to it.

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:23.070
Yeah.
That, of course,

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:24.170
we don't write these emails,

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.000
we can get into this a little bit later.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:31.000
But yeah, there was a bit of a
marketing spin that was like,

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:35.520
hey, this is going away, you
emphasize the scarcity of it.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.430
If you want this particular
hoodie with this particular

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:41.710
Randler logo on it, we're
not making it anymore.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:43.930
But it got conflated with an announcement

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:46.120
about the logo in general.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:50.320
And it really, the
conversation unfortunately

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.350
became about the Randler going away.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:55.160
Yeah.
And that was never the plan.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:59.790
So honestly it wasn't even an
adjustment to fan reaction.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.280
It's like, oh my gosh, they
really love the Randler,

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.940
so we gotta backtrack and
say, we're not taking it away.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:08.610
That was never the plan to take it away,

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:10.020
so it wasn't an adjustment.
But we are

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:13.020
taking responsibility
for the communication

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.280
that seemed to imply that,

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.990
that caused a lot of consternation.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.920
Yeah, so it's a bit unfortunate.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.880
I wanna come back to,
maybe a little bit more

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:24.050
a conversation about why we
decided to change the logo

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.910
